@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 65
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DD
skinparam noteBorderColor #D6B65C
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
title 建议：快速切歌后暂停，迟到结果不能发声
actor 用户
participant "UI / 系统会话" as ui
participant PlaybackCore as core
participant ContentAccess as content
participant AudioRuntime as runtime
用户 -> ui : A -> B
ui -> core : Select(B)
core -> core : selected=B；epoch=21；保留播放意图
core --> ui : 立即显示 B / 准备中
core ->> runtime : 短渐出并停 A；撤销旧衔接计划
core ->> content : prepare(B, epoch=21)
用户 -> ui : 立即切 C
ui -> core : Select(C)
core -> core : selected=C；epoch=22
core ->> content : cancelInterest(21)；prepare(C,22)
note over core, content
命令处理不等待网络、解码或淡化。
取消使用权与可复用缓存分开。
end note
用户 -> ui : 暂停
ui -> core : Pause
core -> core : intent=Pause
core ->> runtime : setIntent(22, Pause)
content -->> core : B 迟到完成(21)
core -> core : 代次不匹配，丢弃控制结果
content -->> core : C 可读取(22)
core ->> runtime : prepare(C,22)
runtime -->> core : Prepared(C,22)
core -> core : 保持 Pause；ReadyPaused
core --> ui : C 已准备，保持暂停
用户 -> ui : 播放
ui -> core : Play
core ->> runtime : setIntent(22,Play)，短渐入
runtime -->> core : Started(C,22)
core --> ui : C 正在播放

@enduml
